# Noetfield V5 Founder Visual & Economic-Value Preservation — 2026-11-16 P0

**Read before any work on `noetfield.com`, the corporate brand, website or product conversions.** This is a narrow, founder-directed design preservation law, not a generic permission gate.

## Protected human visual

- **Founder-approved source:** [PR #388](https://github.com/Noetfield-Systems/Noetfield/pull/388) / commit `340fe2dec55819a997e8aeec60d52f33317a1894`.
- Protected files: `index.html` and `assets/noetfield-institutional-v3.css`; exact Git blobs pinned by `config/noetfield-founder-v5-visual-lock.json` and verified by `python3 scripts/verify-founder-v5-visual-lock.py`.
- Keep the large real-world photographic panorama, genuine Noetfield App image, documentary industrial/architectural images, human-first editorial composition, short copy, restrained typography and cinematic full page.
- **Never** replace that composition with new generic card grids, text-heavy Hero, circles/orbits, abstract cubes/pyramids, agent-status dashboards, or floating explanatory labels. A fresh screenshot of such an agent invention is not a design approval.
- A broad request to improve branding, conversion, marketing, growth or revenue **does not** authorize touching the approved Homepage visual. Only an explicit Founder instruction targeting that visual may authorize updating the golden reference.

## Preserve the economically valuable instructions too

- Brand: **Intelligence for the Real Economy**; build, run and grow intelligent businesses; connect real business, people and the digital economy.
- The flagship App, Company OS, Real-World Capital, human partner/collaborator network, source-backed proof and independent ventures have distinct roles.
- Preserve the commercial decisions in `docs/promo/NOETFIELD_AUDIENCE_FIRST_BRAND_AND_GROWTH_2026-11-16.md` and the incident recovery matrix `docs/promo/NOETFIELD_GROWTH_RECOVERY_QUEUE_2026-11-16.md`.
- For real customer or community workflows, work **only on the matching existing inner page, app or service** and reuse the existing intake, consent, source attribution, approved checkout and CRM. Do not bundle into a homepage restyle. Do not invent customers, revenue or finished capabilities.
- Keep the public website English-only; distinct venture assets and legal boundaries stay separate.

## Why this rule exists

**P0 incident:** `.cursor/incidents/INCIDENT-2026-11-16-001-v5-visual-overwrite-and-growth-work-loss.md`. PR #390 overwrote an approved design; a later whole-tree revert restored the design but discarded unrelated functional conversion changes. Agent tests accepted a self-invented design instead of the founder-approved baseline.

**Implement practical commercial improvements without reopening this incident.** Preserve unrelated work during merges and rollbacks. Do not add artificial review gates to ordinary authorized non-visual work.
